				"objectNames": [
					"Monsieur Os"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 741832201,
					"content": "Speaking of which, isn't Neuvillette...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741832202
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741832202,
					"content": "That's right! Neuvillette's the Hydro Dragon, isn't he? That doesn't mean that this guy's way older than even him, does it?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741832203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 741832203,
					"content": "A new Dragon of Water has already been born? Then again, it has been a long time since even the former Mistress of Many Waters passed... So much time has passed...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Monsieur Os"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7418323,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_NONE",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7418304",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7418304,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Monsieur Os"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 741832301,
					"content": "In any case, the evil dragon Scylla was once the Sebastos's friend, but he revolted at a critical juncture in the showdown between us Remurians and the... Fontainians.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741832302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Monsieur Os"
				},
				{
					"id": 741832302,
					"content": "At that time, Scylla led the brutal Dragonborn to Machimos, intent on breaching the inner city, Capitolium, where the Sebastos resided.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741832303,
						741832304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Monsieur Os"
				},
				{
					"id": 741832303,
					"content": "Machimos?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741832305
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741832305,
					"content": "Yeah, the people in town were always talking about some Machimos, and a belltower or something...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741832306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 741832306,
					"content": "Correct. \"Machimos\" is the outer city of the capital, but should the fell dragon wish to enter the inner city, he must pass through the Initium Iani.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741832307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Monsieur Os"
				},
				{
					"id": 741832307,
					"content": "That is the barrier separating the inner and outer parts of the capital, and the Symphony weaved by the Sebastos and the musicians which covered all of Remuria passed through the Initium Iani and its golden waterways.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741832308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Monsieur Os"
				},
				{
					"id": 741832308,
					"content": "Boethius and his legions used this fact to shut the Initium Iani, thus finally sealing the evil dragon.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741832309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Monsieur Os"
				},
				{
					"id": 741832309,
					"content": "Perhaps Scylla sought to go before the Sebastos's throne, but such an opportunity is now forever lost. Afterward, the evil dragon sank alongside Remuria, and the Sebastos too was lost, remaining so to this very day...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741832310,
						741832311,
						741832312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Monsieur Os"
				},
				{
					"id": 741832310,
					"content": "(Something's not right about that story...)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741832313
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741832313,
					"content": "#Did you recall something, {NICKNAME}?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741832314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Monsieur Os"
				},
				{
					"id": 741832314,
					"content": "It all feels a bit muddled...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741832315
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741832315,
					"content": "That is true... I only heard tell of events after it had all transpired myself, having not been in the capital when the disaster struck...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741832316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Monsieur Os"
				},
				{
					"id": 741832316,
					"content": "Then, none knew just what had happened to the Sebastos. I fear that we can only learn more by proceeding further.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741832317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Monsieur Os"
				},
				{
					"id": 741832317,
					"content": "The large glowing fish that we saw in the castle must be the thoughts that escaped from fissures in Scylla's stony cell.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741832318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Monsieur Os"
				},
				{
					"id": 741832318,
					"content": "I fear he has already taken notice of our presence. Having been sealed here for so long, now that he's finally sensed outsiders, he will naturally find a way to lure us in.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741832319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Monsieur Os"
				},
				{
					"id": 741832319,
					"content": "So that's it...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741832320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 741832320,
					"content": "Hang on a minute! You said that the way to Domus Aurea is through those gates or something, but hasn't Boethius shut them already? Doesn't this mean there's no getting through?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741832321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 741832321,
					"content": "This will prove quite tricky, yes...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741832322
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Monsieur Os"
				},
				{
					"id": 741832322,
					"content": "Bah, there's gotta be a limit to how rude you can be! What's with this \"I'll wait for you at Domus Aurea, mwahaha!\" nonsense when you won't even leave the door open, huh!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741832323
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 741832323,
					"content": "Y'know, why don't we find some way to break the seal on the evil dragon, and get the former foe he beat to break the door down for us?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741832324
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 741832324,
					"content": "No! How could we do such a thing!? I mean, after all, that is one of Remuria's nemeses...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741832325,
						741832326
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Monsieur Os"
				},
				{
					"id": 741832325,
					"content": "But the enemy of my enemy is my friend, no?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741832327
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741832327,
					"content": "That's right. It's been so long. For all you know, he might've decided to turn over a new leaf and be a nice dragon!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741832328
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 741832328,
					"content": "But he is still a dragon...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741832329
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Monsieur Os"
				},
				{
					"id": 741832329,
					"content": "#Eh, come on, so what? Even if he is a dragon, he might be the reasonable kind we can talk with. We've got experience in dealing with dragons, don't we, {NICKNAME}?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 741832326,
					"content": "But Remuria is long gone, no?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741832327
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741832311,
					"content": "(The dreamscape from before... Back then...)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741832313
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741832312,
					"content": "(Scylla should have come and seen Remus before...)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741832313
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741832304,
					"content": "I heard people talking about that in town.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741832305
					]
				}
			]
		},
